// The sizes of things that move and collide, in blocks (see src/world/Bodies.h).
// Anything left out keeps the game's own size. The game loads this again when it changes.
//   "player": its box (a square footprint "width" across, "height" tall), where its eyes
//             are, crouching (a little under 1.5 high fits through a 1.5 gap), and the
//             ledges it walks up without jumping ("stepHeight")
//   "item": a dropped item's box (a cube "size" across)
//   "creatures": each creature's box, by its id (a square footprint and a height)
